msgstr ""

#: src/js/jp4wc/admin/settings/components/SecuritySettings.js:1193
msgid "Do not answer the users REST route (/wp-json/wp/v2/users) for visitors who are not logged in. Logged-in users keep their WordPress permissions (a browser tab opened on the route without a nonce counts as a visitor). Turn it off if a public page of this site lists authors through the REST API."
